onth-on-month changes reflect trading days, with seasonal strength in festive and harvest periods and weakness in monsoon months. Use year-on-year growth."},{"question":"Caveats?","answer":"Value is reported in Rs. crore; fee rates change in April each year, so value growth includes tariff effects. Coverage is of transactions debited to bank accounts under NETC, which may differ from the NHAI-reported total toll collection. RBI data are provisional and are revised in later releases; the dashboard keeps the latest revision seen. Counts are transactions processed by the system, not unique users or goods purchased."}],"related":[],"layer":"added","note":"Source: RBI monthly Payment System Indicators (provisional, revised in later releases). Volume is in lakh (1 lakh = 100,000 = 0.1 million) transactions; value in Rs. crore (1 crore = 10 million). Published roughly a month after the reference month; history on the RBI site starts June 2021.","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T07:24:27+00:00"}